UnitDeploy
├── when checking the chain
│   ├── given the chain ID matches the registry chain ID of the key
│   │   └── it passes
│   ├── given the chain ID is another registered chain
│   │   └── it reverts with UnsupportedChain naming the chain ID
│   └── given the chain ID is the Avalanche mainnet
│       └── it reverts with UnsupportedChain 43114
├── when reading parameters
│   ├── given a params file with the entry
│   │   └── it returns the address and the number
│   ├── given a params file without the entry
│   │   └── it reverts with ParamNotFound naming the key and the entry
│   └── given no params file
│       └── it reverts with ParamNotFound naming the file
└── when writing the deployment record
    ├── given a context that is not a broadcast
    │   └── it writes no file
    └── given the project file permissions
        └── it grants write only to the deployments directory
